      <span class="kicker">Moncton's oil tank people</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 18px;">Straight Answers From a Local Crew That Only Does Oil Tanks</h2>
      <div class="rich"><p>Hub City Tank Co is a Moncton based crew that does one thing: residential heating oil tanks. We handle <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-moncton/">oil tank replacement</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-removal-moncton/">tank removal</a>, and <a href="/buried-oil-tank-removal-moncton/">buried tank removal</a> across Greater Moncton and Southeast New Brunswick. Because that's all we do, we know what local insurers want to see and how to get the job done without dragging it out.</p><p>Most calls start the same way: a letter from the insurance company, or a worrying smell near the furnace. Either way, you'll get a straight answer and a free written estimate before any work starts. If you're pricing things out, our <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-cost/">cost guide</a> breaks down what Moncton homeowners actually pay, and our <a href="/emergency-oil-tank-service-moncton/">24/7 emergency line</a> is there if a tank is leaking right now.</p></div>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-blue" style="margin-top:10px;">More About Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
